_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"这些家伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"别跑......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是疯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人为什么就不能珍惜自己的生命？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"杜宾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"没有办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"彻底击溃他们，然后马上移动！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近卫干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["临光"]}]}
